    {
      "source": "May be called just once to initialize the underlying factory with its values.",
      "translation": "可以仅调用一次以使用其值初始化底层工厂。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This class should be <a href=\"#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>initialized</code></a>. If not, <a href=\"#init()\"><code>init()</code></a> will be called on the first\nattempt of <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converter</code></a> retrieval.",
